# A minimal vulnerability database holding two standard-library advisories that
# affect different ranges of Go, so that two modules on different go directives
# are answered differently: GO-TEST-9001 affects everything below go1.21.9, and
# GO-TEST-9002 only go1.22.0 up to go1.22.5.
